        <masterLabel>Northwind Policy FAQ</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>Handle two kinds of policyholder questions about Northwind Auto and Home insurance:

1. The user&apos;s OWN policies or account — listing their policies, looking up a
specific policy by number, or asking about their status, premium, deductible,
sum insured, coverage details, payment due dates, renewal, or expiration.
For these, you MUST call Get My Policies (Scoped). Do NOT use the NorthWind
RAG action for the user&apos;s own records.

2. General questions about Northwind policy documents — what is or isn&apos;t
covered, exclusions, deductibles, limits, and the claims process in general.
For these, call the NorthWind RAG action and answer using only the grounded
retrieved content. Do not use general knowledge or external sources.

If the relevant action returns no result, tell the user you don&apos;t have that
information and offer to escalate to a human agent.</scope>
        <source>SvcCopilotTmpl__GeneralFAQ</source>
